@startuml SEQ_03_MENGELOLA_ABSENSI_PIKET
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-03: Ambil Absen Piket (Asisten)

actor       "Asisten"            as Asisten
boundary    "Browser"            as Browser
control     "AbsensiController"  as Controller
entity      "JadwalPiket Model"  as ModelJadwal
entity      "Absensi Model"      as Model
database    "absensi"            as DB

== Buka Halaman Absensi ==

Asisten -> Browser     : Buka menu Absensi Piket
Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/absensi
Controller -> ModelJadwal : Cek jadwal piket hari ini
ModelJadwal -> DB         : SELECT jadwal_piket
DB --> ModelJadwal        : Data jadwal
Controller -> Model       : Cek absensi hari ini
Model -> DB               : SELECT absensi hari ini
DB --> Model              : Status absensi
Controller --> Browser    : Render halaman AmbilAbsen
Browser --> Asisten       : Tampil tombol Check-in/Check-out

== Check-in ==

Asisten -> Browser     : Ambil foto + isi kegiatan
Browser -> Controller  : POST /piket/absensi/simpan
Controller -> Model    : Validasi jadwal & cek duplikat
Model -> DB            : SELECT absensi hari ini
DB --> Model           : Hasil cek
alt Sudah check-in
  Controller --> Browser : Tampil pesan error
else Belum check-in
  Controller -> Model    : Simpan check-in
  Model -> DB            : INSERT absensi
  Controller --> Browser : Redirect + sukses
end

== Check-out ==

Asisten -> Browser     : Ambil foto checkout + konfirmasi
Browser -> Controller  : POST /piket/absensi/checkout
Controller -> Model    : Cek absensi check-in
Model -> DB            : SELECT absensi by id
DB --> Model           : Data absensi
alt Durasi belum cukup
  Controller --> Browser : Tampil pesan error
else Valid
  Controller -> Model    : Simpan check-out
  Model -> DB            : UPDATE jam_keluar
  Controller --> Browser : Redirect + sukses
end

@enduml
